{
  "analysis": "The configuration was updated successfully (letter=N, name=NOVA, timeout=720) and all status transitions were applied. The config.json was likely created in the skill_context directory. All 5 transitions completed: idle->work->think->alert->idle. Now I need to verify the files and create the verification note.",
