  "analysis": "The only difference is a trailing newline in config.json (expected_config.json has no newline at end). This is a cosmetic difference that doesn't affect functionality. The key requirements are met: letter=N, name=NOVA, idle_timeout=720, marker=clawd-presence-demo. All state transitions were applied and the final state is idle. The transition_log.txt documents everything.",
