  "analysis": "All requirements are now complete:\n1. Configuration: letter=N, name=NOVA, idle_timeout=720 (12 minutes), marker=clawd-presence-demo\n2. State transitions applied: idle->work->think->alert->idle (final state is idle with empty message)\n3. Monogram assets available (N.txt in assets/monograms/)\n4. transition_log.txt created documenting all transitions for verification\n5. config.json and state.json are in the workspace root\n\nThe presence dashboard is fully configured and ready to display with the display.py script.",
